      <li>
        <a href="https://www.sba.gov/success-story/side-hustle-turned-full-time" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">U.S. SBA, A Side Hustle Turned Full-Time</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.sba.gov/event/83789" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">U.S. SBA learning lab on turning a side hustle into a full-time business</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.upwork.com/press/releases/upwork-unveils-2025s-most-in-demand-skills" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Upwork, 2025 most in-demand skills</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.upwork.com/research/ai-impact-work-categories" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Upwork Research, AI reshaping freelance work categories</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://investors.upwork.com/node/11771/pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Upwork study on independent skilled knowledge work</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://razorpay.com/learn/side-business-ideas/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Razorpay guide to side business ideas in India</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.weforum.org/publications/the-future-of-jobs-report-2025/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">World Economic Forum, Future of Jobs Report 2025</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</CareerResourceLayout>
